# SQL Editor agent memory (main ≥ 0.2.317)

Base: `main` @ `0.2.317` · Feature merge: PR #121 · Blank-page harden: PR #120

## Product context
FoxSchema = schema diff/migration + SQL Editor + workspaces. Destinations checklist, Schema explorer, Monaco, code cells (`-- @js` / `-- @ts` / `-- @node` / `-- @nodets`), table blueprint, bookmarks/samples, Grants, Backup & Restore, Git migrations.

## Feature-module architecture (#498–#504, built 2026-10-10)
- **One feature folder per side**, composed in one static registry:
  - Server: `packages/server/src/app/feature-registry.ts` (+ every feature `index.ts`)
  - Web: `apps/web/src/frontend/app/features/featureRegistry.ts` (+ `viewIds.ts`)
- **Scaffold**: `npm run feature:new -- <id>` registers both sides.
- **Guides**: `docs/architecture/FEATURE-MODULE-GUIDE.md`, `FEATURE-DEPENDENCY-RULES.md`; plan status in `docs/plans/2026-10-10-feature-architecture.md`.
- **Platform** (not features): `packages/server/src/platform/{identity,authorization,workspaces,connections,settings,guards,http,…}` — no feature↔feature cycles; import other features only via their `index.ts`.
- **Web**: feature state lives inside the feature; outside code imports only root entries. Shell driven by the view registry (not a ternary chain in `App.tsx`).
- **Dialect imports in web**: through `@foxschema/ui-shared` only (#488) — never `@foxschema/sql` directly.
- Architecture tests: `packages/server/.../architecture.test.ts`, `apps/web/.../architecture.test.ts`.

