- **Grants view**: held grants grid (schema-optional match); routine grants matrix per engine.
- **Backup & Restore** (Utils): dialect command builders; confirmed server-side SQL backup run + list recorded backups; never runs restore from UI. SQL Server backup listing fixed in review tests.
